## API Key for Dev 2

> **Do not give Dev 2 the master key.**
> Generate a scoped virtual key in LiteLLM for LibreChat to use.
>
> ```
> POST <LITELLM_URL>/key/generate
> Authorization: Bearer <LITELLM_MASTER_KEY>
>
> {
>   "key_alias": "librechat-nonprod",
>   "models": ["<MODEL_FLAGSHIP_NAME>", "<MODEL_FAST_NAME>"],
>   "duration": null
> }
> ```
>
> Record the generated key below.

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Virtual key alias | `librechat-nonprod` |
| Virtual key value | `<GENERATED_VIRTUAL_KEY>` |
| Permitted models | `<MODEL_FLAGSHIP_NAME>`, `<MODEL_FAST_NAME>` |

